00:58:48,644 --> 00:58:54,164
Well then, before I reveal the best present ever, I've got an announcement to make!

607
00:58:55,224 --> 00:59:02,224
[Sign: Raora Panthera Pencil Case & Keychain]

608
00:59:02,704 --> 00:59:16,984
Yes, this is a cute pencil case with me in our Chattino costume, so I hope you guys can bring it everywhere—at school, in the office, literally everywhere!

609
00:59:17,124 --> 00:59:20,244
So please don't miss it out, okay?

610
00:59:21,584 --> 00:59:26,604
Ah, that was such a fun 3D showcase with lots of things happening!

611
00:59:26,884 --> 00:59:31,164
Did everyone have fun, Chattino? Did you guys have fun?

612
00:59:32,624 --> 00:59:37,584
Thank you! I'm so happy to hear that!

613
00:59:37,984 --> 00:59:52,624
Thank you! Since you guys had a great time with me today, I'm so happy! Thank you! I'll keep doing my best to bring fun streams and more 3D live performances like this one today, okay?

614
00:59:52,924 --> 00:59:59,484
I appreciate you guys so much! Thank you, Chattino, for all your support! Thank you, thank you, thank you!

615
01:00:00,351 --> 01:00:01,411
Finally!

616
01:00:01,411 --> 01:00:07,971
It's the longer-awaited present from me to everyone!
It's the long-awaited present from me to everyone!

617
01:00:08,671 --> 01:00:11,851
Are you guys ready? The present is...

618
01:00:12,531 --> 01:00:17,751
My first original song!

619
01:00:21,151 --> 01:00:35,191
I'm so happy! It's full of things I like, and so many personal touches. I worked really, really hard on this song, so I hope you guys are going to take a listen to it, okay?

620
01:00:35,631 --> 01:00:40,511
Are you guys ready? Are you guys excited? Let's go to the stage!

621
01:00:51,200 --> 01:00:53,730
Gacha×Gacha ADVENTURE!

622
01:00:54,120 --> 01:00:55,870
(はい！はい！はい！ Pon! Pon!)
(Hai! Hai! Hai! Pon! Pon!)

623
01:00:59,180 --> 01:01:02,920
(Gacha, Gacha, RAOOOO!!)

624
01:01:05,090 --> 01:01:07,550
さあ、さあ、お宝探しだ
Come on, come on, it's treasure hunting time!

625
01:01:07,920 --> 01:01:10,010
今日は、ど～んな獲物が見つかるかにゃ？
I wonder what kind of prize we'll find today?

626
01:01:10,690 --> 01:01:15,110
ほら、ほら、みんなも一緒に！楽しい冒険、しゅっ～ぱつ！
Hey, hey, everyone come along too! A fun adventure, set sail!

627
01:01:15,990 --> 01:01:19,570
ハマっちゃったら抜け出せないの～
Once you get hooked, you can't escape~

628
01:01:20,200 --> 01:01:21,670
食べ物ぬいぐるみ
Food plushies,

629
01:01:21,940 --> 01:01:23,330
PizzaもPastaも全部！
Pizza and Pasta, all of it!

630
01:01:23,460 --> 01:01:25,660
詰め込んだ迷宮は謎だらけワクワク止まらない
Packed into this mysterious labyrinth, the excitement never stops!

631
01:01:26,950 --> 01:01:32,060
取れそうで取れなくてイライラクレーンゲームにゃ～もう！
Almost got it, but couldn't, so frustrating... Crane game, nya-mou!

632
01:01:33,370 --> 01:01:40,090
諦めたままでいたい…するはずないじゃない！目指せコンプリート！
You think I'd just give up...? No way! Aim for the complete collection!

633
01:01:41,320 --> 01:01:47,470
さあ、もう一回！止めても無駄だよ、もう一回！繰り返すデジャヴ
Come on, one more time! Stopping is useless, one more time! Repeating deja vu,

634
01:01:47,700 --> 01:01:51,670
諦めろって言わないで、三度目の正直！
Don't tell me to give up, third time's the charm!

635
01:01:52,890 --> 01:01:57,290
だからもう満身創痍、溢れる想いがとめられない、これって大職！？
That's why I'm battered and bruised, my overflowing feelings can't be stopped, is this a calling?!

636
01:01:57,970 --> 01:02:02,920
楽しいことで満ちてるこの先の未来へと、はい、せーのっ！
Toward a future filled with fun things, ready, one, two!

637
01:02:04,050 --> 01:02:06,420
Gacha×Gacha ADVENTURE!

638
01:02:07,060 --> 01:02:10,010
(ガチャ、ガチャ、ガチャ、ガチャ…ゲーム、リスタート！)
(Gacha, gacha, gacha, gacha... Game restart!)

639
01:02:11,550 --> 01:02:13,780
グルグル回しまくっちゃえ
Spin it round and round!

640
01:02:14,380 --> 01:02:16,240
「ダメだ…止まんない！」
"No way... It won't stop!"

641
01:02:17,020 --> 01:02:21,030
お目当ての獲物が出るまでお願い…もう一回！
Until my target prize drops, please... one more time!

642
01:02:22,110 --> 01:02:25,200
ビートに乗ったら止まれないの～
Once you ride the beat, you can't stop~

643
01:02:25,690 --> 01:02:27,520
音ゲーもお手のもの
Rhythm games are a breeze too,

644
01:02:27,850 --> 01:02:30,660
ComboもFeverも全部キメたら完璧Groove！
Hit all the combos and fevers for the perfect groove!

645
01:02:32,010 --> 01:02:32,580
(Andiamo!)

646
01:02:32,990 --> 01:02:38,370
レースゲームエンジン全開でアチアチ白熱バトル！いけいけ Go! Go! Go!
Racing game, engines full throttle, blazing hot intense battle! Go, go, go!

647
01:02:39,500 --> 01:02:41,970
コーナーで差をつできたら目指すは1位だー！
Pulling ahead at the corner, aiming for 1st place!

648
01:02:47,630 --> 01:02:57,580
さあ、もう一回でも今日は終わり、もう一回言いかけて止まる、楽しかった気持ちが胸をきゅっとするの
Come on, even if it's one more time, today is ending, starting to say 'one more time' and stopping, the fun feeling makes my heart squeeze tight

649
01:02:58,840 --> 01:03:05,090
ねぇねぇ、もうバイバイしなきゃダメ？まだ帰りたくない これって恋かな！？
Hey hey, do we have to say bye-bye already? I don't want to go home yet, is this love!?

650
01:03:05,570 --> 01:03:10,010
ワクワクで満ち溢れたこの先の日々も、一緒に冒険しよう！
Even the days ahead filled with excitement, let's go on an adventure together!

651
01:03:11,260 --> 01:03:16,420
さあ、もう一回、止めても無駄だよ、もう一回、繰り返すデジャヴ
Come on, one more time, stopping is useless, one more time, repeating deja vu,

652
01:03:17,160 --> 01:03:21,940
諦めろって言わないで、何度でもチャレンジ！
Don't tell me to give up, challenge it no matter how many times!

653
01:03:22,560 --> 01:03:26,610
だからもう満身創痍、溢れる想いがとめられない、これぞ大職！？
That's why I'm battered and bruised, my overflowing feelings can't be stopped, is this a calling?!

654
01:03:29,720 --> 01:03:32,530
何度でもやり直せるそう、人生は！みんなも一緒に！
You can start over no matter how many times, yes, life is! Everyone together too!

655
01:03:34,110 --> 01:03:36,660
Gacha×Gacha ADVENTURE!

656
01:03:36,910 --> 01:03:39,560
(はい！はい！はい！ Pon! Pon!)
(Hai! Hai! Hai! Pon! Pon!)

657
01:03:43,020 --> 01:03:46,430
(Gacha, Gacha, RAOOOO!!)

658
01:03:46,430 --> 01:03:49,620
「また一緒に冒険しようね！Ciao ciao!」
"Let's go on an adventure together again! Ciao ciao!"

659
01:04:00,224 --> 01:04:03,544
That was so much fun!

660
01:04:06,284 --> 01:04:10,694
How did you like it, Chattini? Did you like it?

661
01:04:12,264 --> 01:04:16,244
Thank you for watching and listening!

662
01:04:17,024 --> 01:04:24,424
Today was so much fun. Thank you so much, everyone, for all your support! Thank you, thank you, Chattini, thank you!

663
01:04:24,974 --> 01:04:29,574
I can't wait to see you all again! Until next time!

664
01:04:31,084 --> 01:04:32,524
Ciao ciao!

665
01:04:37,994 --> 01:04:42,634
Big cat means big trouble!

666
01:04:45,096 --> 01:04:59,096
[Text: Thank you Chattini for all your support! I still can't believe this day finally came! RAOOOO~ This is the very first step towards my idol dream, and I will always do my best! Let's keep going together to new chapters! BIG CAT means BIG DREAMS!]

